# Privacy Policy — Biak Ethnonumeric Puzzle

**Effective date:** 1 September 2026

**App:** Biak Ethnonumeric Puzzle
**Developer:** PT Tifa Pratama Jaya, Jayapura, Papua, Indonesia
**Contact:** developer@tifapratamajaya.com

This Privacy Policy explains how the Biak Ethnonumeric Puzzle mobile application (the "App") handles information. We designed the App to run entirely on your device and to respect your privacy. In short: **the App does not collect, store, or share any personal data.**

## Summary

- The App works fully offline and requests no special permissions.
- The App does not collect any personal or identifying information.
- The App contains no advertising, no analytics, and no third‑party tracking.
- The only data the App saves is your own in‑app preferences (such as the selected theme and language), and this is kept locally on your device and never transmitted anywhere.

## Information We Collect

We do **not** collect any personal data. The App does not ask for your name, email address, phone number, location, contacts, photos, or any similar information, and it does not create a user account.

The App does not gather usage statistics, crash reports, advertising identifiers, or device identifiers, and it does not profile you in any way.

## Information Stored on Your Device

To make the App work the way you expect, it saves a small amount of preference information **locally on your device only**, using the operating system's standard app‑preferences storage. This currently includes settings such as:

- your selected display theme (for example, Papua Nature, Sky Blue, or Dark); and
- your selected app language (for example, follow system, English, or Indonesian).

This information stays on your device, is used only to remember your choices between sessions, and is never sent to us or to anyone else. It is not personal data and cannot be used to identify you.

## Permissions

The App does not request any Android runtime permissions. It does not access the internet, your location, camera, microphone, contacts, storage, or any other sensitive device feature.

## Sharing of Information

Because the App does not collect any personal data, there is nothing to share. We do not sell, rent, trade, or otherwise disclose personal information to third parties. The App does not integrate advertising networks, analytics services, or other third‑party software development kits that would receive your data.

## Data Security

Since the App does not collect or transmit personal data, there is no personal information for us to secure on a server. The preference data stored on your device is protected by your device's own security and by the standard sandboxing that Android applies to each app's private storage.

## Children's Privacy

The App is an educational tool suitable for a general audience, including children. It does not knowingly collect any information from anyone, including children. Because no personal data is collected, no parental consent is required for data collection, and there is no data about a child (or any user) for us to access, use, or disclose.

## Your Choices and Data Deletion

You remain in control at all times:

- You can change or reset your saved preferences from within the App's Settings at any time.
- You can clear the App's locally stored data through your device's system settings (for example, **Settings → Apps → Biak Ethnonumeric Puzzle → Storage → Clear data**).
- Uninstalling the App removes all of its locally stored preference data from your device.

## Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time, for example if the App gains new features. When we do, we will revise the "Effective date" above and make the updated policy available within the App and/or at the location where the App is distributed. Significant changes will be highlighted where practical. Your continued use of the App after an update means you accept the revised policy.

